  "summary": "USAA HR Technical Domain Lead - Leading a large team developing software.  We are transforming the way we move data through the HR eco system realtime using Workday webhooks and Rest.  Including the use of streaming data in Kafka.  HR Domain level storage in Couchbase.  Extensive experience developing Workday Studio Integrations, Core Connectors, EIBs, Workday Business Processes, Workday RESTful Services, Workday Soap Services and OAuth2.  In addition I have extensive experience working in Java with RESTful Services, SOAP Services, Object Oriented Design, Javascript, Frontend Design and various Database technologies to include Oracle, MSSQL and UDB.\n\nAdditional Responsibilities include:\nTechnology Hiring for HR that includes Workday, Java, Database and Salesforce.\nDeveloping an HR wide release process, structure and tools to track business and IT changes for the HR systems.\nResponsible for proper solution architecture design, project estimates, mentoring multiple team members, developing software, enforcing coding standards.   I also work closely with enterprise architects, business teams and management to ensure that software development efforts are successfully implemented with appropriate architectural standards, on time and on budget.",
